          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "археолог (arkheológ) — \"an archaeologist\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Археолог работал в пустыне два года. Arkheológ rabótal v pustýne dva góda. The archaeologist worked in the desert for two years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Археология — archaeology."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "археолог (arkheológ) is built on Greek arkhaîos \"ancient\", from arkhḗ \"beginning\", and lógos \"word, account\" (EtymDB): one who studies ancient things."
            }
          ]
        },
